Z||000002||ChadMan||10-06-1999||09:10 AM||||The snorkel wasn't available on the street-going version of the Indy Fiero, and the door decals were a dealer-installed option (if memory serves).  I think it's worth $3K.<P>I don't think pace cars are valuable enough for people to start making replicas out of base Fieros (yet!).||||reg||1
