Z||000004||88 Fiero||10-06-1999||10:33 AM||||To be sure that you are looking a Pace is that one the interior seat is Red in the Center and the carpeting is Red. It should have a stripe above the Rockers of the car. It should have the emblem in the front that says Indy Fiero. Both Side fenders should have the metal Wings that says Indianapolis Motorspeedway. The engine is the 2.5 Cylinder Iron Duke which is painted in Silver.||||reg||1
